== Mod List

Wave 1 introduces visual, sound, and immersion mods. Still no gameplay-altering mechanics — the focus is on improving the sensory experience of the battlefield.

#block(fill: rgb("f5f5f5"), stroke: (left: 4pt + rgb("2980b9")), inset: 12pt, radius: 4pt)[
=== Continued from Wave 0

All mods from Wave 0 remain active. Do not disable any previous wave's mods unless a specific conflict is noted in `conflicts-mods.md`.
]

#block(fill: rgb("f5f5f5"), stroke: (left: 4pt + rgb("8e44ad")), inset: 12pt, radius: 4pt)[
== #link("https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=2222778153")[RR Immersive Maps]

- *Type:* Graphics
- *Mod ID:* `2222778153`
- *Dependencies:* [#link("https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=450814997")[CBA_A3]], [#link("https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=463939057")[ACE]]
- *Description:* Player characters physically hold up a map and compass with custom animations. You can look at maps from dead bodies, copy markers from other players' maps, and place maps on the ground.
- *System Impact:* Pure visual animation overhaul. No gameplay mechanics changed. All features configurable via CBA addon options.
- *Verified:* 2025-06-17
]

#block(fill: rgb("f5f5f5"), stroke: (left: 4pt + rgb("8e44ad")), inset: 12pt, radius: 4pt)[
== #link("https://steamcommunity.com/workshop/filedetails/?id=3581479215")[「RSS」 Immersive Hud]

- *Type:* UI/QoL
- *Mod ID:* `3581479215`
- *Description:* Removes vanilla ammo counter, grenade display, and stance indicator when on foot. Check ammo by looking at your weapon, see medical status by looking down at yourself. Updated overhaul of WebKnight's original Immersive Hud with ACE3 medical integration, safe mode support, and improved magazine display.
- *System Impact:* Changes how information is displayed. Does not alter weapon stats, damage, or AI behavior. ACE3 features activate automatically when ACE is present.
- *Verified:* 2025-06-17
]

